  "description": "A complete .NET 9 client library for MercadoBitcoin API v4 with native HTTP/2 support and System.Text.Json. Access to all public & private endpoints: trading, wallet, account. Features: HTTP/2 by default, resilient retry (exponential backoff + jitter + manual circuit breaker), cancellation tokens everywhere, custom User-Agent, native metrics (System.Diagnostics.Metrics counters + latency histogram), comprehensive test suite (64 tests), clean architecture, AOT compatibility, Source Generators.",
